{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Avidy&quot; is a 2.5D top-down action-adventure game. The protagonist stumbles upon a remote town and becomes entangled in a mysterious ritual.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the town is shrouded in fog, the space of each area seems to undergo subtle changes, causing the original path to lead to a different destination. Unknown monsters also lurk within the fog.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Attack Methods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist can collect different masks. Wearing them grants them different powers through their magical performances. Switching between masks allows the protagonist to gain flexible attack methods.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Changing World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world gradually changes as the protagonist explores, not only in the environment but also in the people and events. Every decision the protagonist makes is closely linked to the outcome of this world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907180?t=1756869487","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907180?t=1756869487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907180/01ae99b5e0a8dbc44fdee415175e0ec65caac3ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756869487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907180/01ae99b5e0a8dbc44fdee415175e0ec65caac3ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756869487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Steam Turn Notifications","id":32},{"description":"Includes Source SDK","id":16},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Avidy&quot; is a 2.5D top-down action-adventure game. The protagonist stumbles upon a remote town and becomes entangled in a mysterious ritual.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the town is shrouded in fog, the space of each area seems to undergo subtle changes, causing the original path to lead to a different destination. Unknown monsters also lurk within the fog.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Attack Methods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist can collect different masks. Wearing them grants them different powers through their magical performances. Switching between masks allows the protagonist to gain flexible attack methods.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Changing World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world gradually changes as the protagonist explores, not only in the environment but also in the people and events. Every decision the protagonist makes is closely linked to the outcome of this world.</p>","developers":["Dean"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907180/d7e89634f1251557b46f4d40258659160f5a0687/header.jpg?t=1756869487","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3907180/132754276/711deb84b30052ce95dbe80e268cc4e51e411c15/1756369669/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756869485","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3907180/132754276/711deb84b30052ce